% voices that these V: fields had made, a leak that the sanitize and
% valgrind builds report on abcmatch_sample_voices_header.
X:1
T:Voices declared in the header
C:abc2midi test
M:C
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
V:S
V:A
K:C
[V:S] C E G c |]
[V:A] E G c e |]
